<title>UK: Spain adds 3.0 bln French francs to July 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>Spain adds 3.0 bln French francs to July 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by joint lead managers Societe Generale and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPAIN</p>
<p> AMT   *3.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    31.JUL.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  105.375   PAY DATE    08.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    103.70    SPREAD	**</p>
<p> NOTES     *ADD-ON TO OUTSTANDING 6.0 BLN FRF ISSUE.</p>
<p>	    **10 BP OVER 2006 PAT OR 13 BP OVER CURVE</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    PARIS/LUX PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  SPAIN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.673     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
